        "summary": "2-MMC (2-methylmethcathinone) is a synthetic cathinone stimulant that emerged as a major replacement following 3-MMC bans. Unlike 3-MMC and 4-MMC, 2-MMC acts predominantly on dopamine and norepinephrine (NDRA/NDRI) with minimal serotonergic release. It produces clean physical stimulation, wakefulness, and euphoria, but notably lacks the warm empathogenic and entactogenic qualities of its isomers.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Less entactogenic than 3-MMC, providing clean dopaminergic focus (3-5h) with redosing risks when users seek missing empathic euphoria.",
        "effectsSummary": "Physical and mental stimulation, increased energy, elevated heart rate, moderate vasoconstriction, and marked redosing urge upon comedown.",
        "dosageRemark": "Generally less euphorigenic per dose than 3-MMC, leading some users to dangerously escalate doses in search of missing empathogenic effects, drastically increasing cardiovascular strain.",
        "generalRisks": "Tachycardia, hypertension, dehydration, severe insomnia, anxiety, bruxism, and cardiovascular exhaustion during binge sessions.",
