        "summary": "Acetyl-Fentanyl is an opioid analgesic substance that is an analogue of Fentanyl. It's potency is roughly ~6.67 times that of Morphine. Making it ~15 times less potent than its parent compound Fentanyl.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Compared to Morphine and Fentanyl, acetylfentanyl is 15-30 times more potent than morphine (about 3 times weaker than pure fentanyl), with an ultra-short duration and lethal respiratory arrest risk.",
