        "summary": "Chlorpromazine is a prescription antipsychotic (neuroleptic) medication used in schizophrenia, bipolar mania/maintenance, or severe agitation. Prototypical first-generation aliphatic phenothiazine antipsychotic (Largactil) used for psychosis, severe agitation, intractable hiccups, and nausea.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Historic first antipsychotic characterized by heavy sedative, antihistaminic, and alpha-adrenergic blocking effects causing marked motor slowdown.",
