        "summary": "Clobazam is a prescription benzodiazepine acting as a positive allosteric modulator of GABA-A receptors. 1,5-benzodiazepine anxiolytic and adjunctive anticonvulsant (Urbanyl, Onfi) causing slightly less motor sedation per anxiolytic/antiepileptic unit than classic 1,4-benzodiazepines. Approximate potency equivalence: ~20 mg Clobazam ≈ 10 mg Diazepam. Do not combine with other CNS depressants.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: 1,5-benzodiazepine roughly equipotent to diazepam (10-20 mg), delivering high anticonvulsant and anxiolytic efficacy with less motor sedation.",
