        "summary": "A weak semi-synthetic opioid analgesic and antitussive (anti-cough) drug. Often sold as a syrup in combination with aspirin or paracetamol. Not to be confused with the slightly less potent codeine.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Compared to Codeine, dihydrocodeine is twice as potent per milligram, does not rely on CYP2D6 metabolism to work, and produces more consistent analgesia.",
