        "summary": "Dipentylone (dimethylpentylone or bk-DMBDP) is a substituted cathinone that surfaced to replace eutylone and ephylone following their international scheduling. It acts as a dopaminergic and noradrenergic stimulant with a long duration and modest empathogenic qualities.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Moderate-potency stimulant cathinone less euphoric than eutylone, providing sustained wakefulness accompanied by peripheral cardiac stimulation.",
