        "summary": "Duloxetine (Cymbalta) is a balanced serotonin-norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor (SNRI) prescribed for major depression, generalized anxiety disorder, diabetic neuropathic pain, and fibromyalgia.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Dual serotonin-norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor indicated for major depression and neuropathic pain, known for sharp discontinuation symptoms on abrupt cessation.",
