        "summary": "Efavirenz (sold by the brand name Sustiva) is an antiretroviral medication used in the treatment and prevention of HIV/AIDS. It is notable for being able to produce psychedelic and hallucinogenic effects despite possessing an extremely novel pharmacological profile and chemical structure not shared with any other psychedelic substance.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Non-nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitor known to trigger vivid dreams, lightheadedness, and mild dissociative phenomena during early treatment.",
