        "summary": "Eutylone (bk-EBDB) is a substituted methylenedioxyphenethylamine-type cathinone related to ethylone and butylone. Highly prevalent in global seizures between 2019 and 2023, it was frequently sold adulterated as counterfeit MDMA. It produces lasting stimulation with a relatively short euphoric peak followed by lingering adrenergic activity up to 8 hours.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Entactogenic cathinone akin to methylone but longer-lasting and less intensely empathic, carrying high compulsive redosing tendencies.",
