        "summary": "4-Fluorophenibut (also known as F-Phenibut and fluorobut) is a central nervous system depressant and derivative of phenibut. It acts as a potent GABAB receptor agonist, producing anxiolytic, sedative, and physical euphoria effects at lower dosages than phenibut.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Fluorinated phenibut analog 5 to 10 times more potent with significantly faster onset (1-2h vs 4h), delivering potent anxiolysis and sedation.",
