        "summary": "A drug made out of the leaves of Mitragyna Speciosa, which is related to coffee. Stimulating at lower doses, with opioid effects at higher doses. Frequent heavy use can cause physical addiction and withdrawals.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Compared to pharmaceutical opioids, kratom features a unique natural biphasic profile: stimulating at lower doses (<3g) and sedating/analgesic at higher doses (>5g), with significantly lower risk of fatal respiratory depression.",
