        "summary": "A stimulant and empathogen. Similar to MDMA but typically produces more visuals than MDMA. Known to be more neurotoxic than MDMA, and is a minor metabolite of MDMA. Duration and onset similar to MDMA. The common Marquis reagent test cannot differentiate MDA and MDMA.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Compared to MDMA, MDA is more potent, significantly more visual and hallucinogenic, lasts longer (6-8h), but carries higher serotonergic neurotoxicity.",
