        "summary": "Methiopropamine (also known as MPA) is a stimulant substance of the thiophene class. It is a ring-based structural analogue of methamphetamine.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Thiophene-based structural analog of methamphetamine producing primarily physical stimulation and wakefulness with negligible euphoria.",
