        "summary": "Methocarbamol (Lumirelax / Robaxin) is a centrally acting carbamate muscle relaxant prescribed for painful acute muscle spasms and lumbago.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Centrally acting skeletal muscle relaxant with mild calming effects, easing acute back spasms without benzodiazepine-like physical dependency.",
