        "summary": "Milnacipran (Ixel, Savella) is a norepinephrine-preferring SNRI used for major depression and fibromyalgia, requiring strict twice-daily (12-hour) administration due to its 8-hour half-life.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Balanced SNRI with stronger noradrenergic drive than venlafaxine, boosting physical energy and reducing widespread fibromyalgia pain.",
