        "summary": "Flmodafinil (also known as CRL-40,940, bisfluoromodafinil, and N-Methylbisfluoromodafinil) is a synthetic eugeroic substance closely related to modafinil. It acts as a selective dopamine reuptake inhibitor, promoting wakefulness, alertness, and cognitive endurance with higher potency and bioavailability than modafinil.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Fluorinated modafinil derivative sustaining long-lasting cognitive vigilance without tachycardia or sudden fatigue crashes.",
