        "summary": "Nalmefene (Selincro 18 mg) is a mu/delta-opioid antagonist and partial kappa-opioid agonist prescribed 'as-needed' 1 to 2 hours before anticipated alcohol consumption to reduce heavy drinking.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Long-acting oral opioid receptor modulator reducing heavy alcohol consumption on an as-needed basis without requiring total abstinence.",
