        "summary": "Nitrous oxide (also known as laughing gas, nitrous, NOS, and informally as hippy-crack). Whipped cream chargers/cartridges are called whippits (also spelled “whippits”), nangs, or bulbs.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Inhaled dissociative gas with immediate, ultra-brief action (1-3 min), inducing floating physical numbness, giggling euphoria, and characteristic flanging audio.",
