        "summary": "Omberacetam (also known as GVS-111 and Noopept) is a nootropic substance of the peptide class. Omberacetam is promoted and prescribed in Russia and neighbouring countries as a nootropic with neuroprotective properties.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Compared to Piracetam, omberacetam (Noopept) is roughly 1,000 times more potent (dosed at 10-30 mg vs 1,200-4,800 mg) with rapid neuroprotective action.",
