        "summary": "Paliperidone is a prescription antipsychotic (neuroleptic) medication used in schizophrenia, bipolar mania/maintenance, or severe agitation. Active 9-hydroxy metabolite of risperidone (Invega) prescribed once every 24 hours in the morning for schizophrenia and schizoaffective disorder.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Active metabolite of risperidone cleared renally, providing steady antipsychotic coverage with elevated prolactin elevation liability.",
