        "summary": "Phloroglucinol (Spasfon) is a widely used musculotropic antispasmodic prescribed for spasmodic abdominal, biliary, renal colic, and gynecological/uterine pain.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Direct smooth muscle antispasmodic lacking anticholinergic side effects, relieving gastrointestinal and uterine cramping without sedation.",
