        "summary": "Propranolol (Avlocardyl, Inderal) is a lipophilic non-selective beta-1/beta-2 adrenergic blocker widely used in psychiatry and neurology for situational/performance anxiety (blocks adrenaline palpitations, shaking, sweating), antipsychotic akathisia, lithium/essential tremor, and migraine prophylaxis.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Non-selective beta-blocker suppressing somatic manifestations of performance anxiety (tremors, palpitations) without cognitive blunting or dependence.",
