        "summary": "An opioid analgesic drug with potency somewhere between tramadol and morphine, and with a similar action to Tramadol. Also an adrenergic reuptake inhibitor. High addiction potential. Potential for respiratory depression in overdose. Should not be combined with depressants or stimulants.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Compared to Tramadol, tapentadol is a stronger direct mu-opioid agonist combined with noradrenaline reuptake inhibition without major serotonin action, proving more effective for neuropathic pain.",
