        "summary": "Thiocolchicoside (Miorel, Coltramyl) is a semi-synthetic colchicoside muscle relaxant subject to strict regulatory intervals (every 12 hours, max 7 days) due to seizure and genotoxicity risks.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Colchicine-derived muscle relaxant easing painful contractures without heavy CNS sedation, but carrying pro-convulsant precautions.",
