        "summary": "Valproate (Dépakine, Dépakote, Dépamide) is a broad-spectrum GABAergic/sodium-channel anticonvulsant, antimanic bipolar mood stabilizer, and migraine preventative.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Broad-spectrum anticonvulsant and mood stabilizer enhancing GABA activity, highly protective against acute mania but strictly teratogenic in pregnancy.",
        "effectsSummary": "Suppresses epileptic seizures and acute mania/agitation; may cause mild sedation, tremor, GI upset, and appetite increase.",
