        "summary": "Venlafaxine (Effexor) is a serotonin-norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor (SNRI) used for major depression, generalized/social anxiety, panic disorder, and neuropathic pain. Known for rapid withdrawal symptoms if an intake is delayed.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Benchmark SNRI providing stimulating mood elevation (serotonergic at low doses, noradrenergic higher), notorious for abrupt withdrawal 'brain zaps'.",
