        "summary": "Vortioxetine (Brintellix / Trintellix) is a multimodal serotonergic antidepressant (SERT inhibitor + 5-HT1A agonist + 5-HT3/5-HT7/5-HT1D antagonist) used for major depressive disorder, particularly with cognitive slowing.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Multimodal antidepressant modulating multiple 5-HT receptors to protect cognitive speed and executive performance alongside mood recovery.",
