        "summary": "Zolmitriptan (Zomig / Zomigoro) is a second-generation 5-HT1B/1D agonist triptan for acute migraine attacks with higher oral bioavailability than sumatriptan.\n\n⚖️ Comparative profile: Second-generation 5-HT1B/1D triptan offering superior bioavailability and fast cerebral penetration for acute migraine termination.",
